      "data": {
        "text": "**Developing SSML Generation**\n\nI've just finished creating the `synthesize_ssml.py` file. It's designed to use the Google Cloud Text-to-Speech API to synthesize SSML. I'm focusing on incorporating voice and prosody controls within the script. The Google Cloud Text-to-Speech API is being leveraged, as indicated by the import and usage.\n\n\n**Refining SSML Synthesis**\n\nI have finished the `synthesize_ssml.py` script. It successfully employs the Google Cloud Text-to-Speech API. I have included voice and prosody controls within this program, utilizing the client as indicated. I've built the framework. Now, to test it, and add to it.\n\n\n",
